4\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1443391-hollow-sheet-editable-pdf\"> Hollow Sheet - Editable PDF - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1443391-hollow-sheet-editable-pdf\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1443391-hollow-sheet-editable-pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Good afternoon, I thought I would share the fruits of my labors. I created a Hollow Sheet (with some advice from MrGone) for a game I am planning. Unfortunately, it was too large to attach to this post but it's free to download on my DeviantART: https://www.deviantart.com/ladisilverfox/art/CtL-Hollow-Sheet-Editable-PDF-875954436 (https://www.deviantart.com/ladisilverfox/art/CtL-Hollow-Sheet-Editable-PDF-875954436) Thank you very much. I hope you enjoy it. :o </div> </div> </div><br /> Editible PDF Hollow Creation Sheet [E1]<br /> <br /> Thank you. ^-^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1362-ladisilverfox","name":"LadiSilverfox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1362_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-24T16:31:56-07:00","id":1516047,"title":"","content":"If possible, add my Hedge Chase Fillable Document. It helps a little when calculating all those pesky incoveniences that may alter a Hedge Chase.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516022-hedge-chase-fillable-spreadsheet\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516022-hedge-chase-fillable-spreadsheet\"> Hedge Chase Fillable Spreadsheet - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516022-hedge-chase-fillable-spreadsheet\"> https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516022-hedge-chase-fillable-spreadsheet </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> After reading and analyzing extensively the modifiers for Hedge Chase, I decided to make a spreadsheet to calculate automatically the number of success needed to navigate trought it. Since it cost nothing to share, I decided to post here for you guys. https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i5K1pLjwszvGYLOc7Ub1vi </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" 